\subsection{Left exactness of flat pullback}
\label{sec:pullback_pfl_decomposition}

Let \(\varphi\) be the morphism of ring sheaves underlying \(g\). Pullback of sheaves
of modules factors through presheaves: one forgets the sheaf condition, applies
presheaf pullback, and sheafifies. Left exactness can therefore be checked on these
three factors.

